# Apps — Web (`apps/web`)

## Architecture

- React Router 7 SPA; route modules for code splitting.
- Auth / tenant / permission guards in `app/routing/`.
- Data via HTTP API clients + **TanStack Query** (keys, `staleTime`, mutation invalidation) — see `apps/web/README.md`.
- **No direct Firestore** for business data. No importing Firestore SDKs in app UI.

## UI

- Primitives from `@repo/ui` only for overlays/toasts/base components.
- Follow existing rules: `ui-overlays.mdc`, `ui-toasts.mdc`, `ui-design-manual.mdc`.
- Semantic Tailwind: `bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`, `bg-card` — not raw scale steps like `bg-primary-600`.
- Tenant branding via Appearance / `TenantBrandingProvider` — `docs/guides/theme-and-tenant-branding.md`.
- Layout JSON / presets: `docs/ui-design-manual/README.md`, `docs/guides/advanced-ui-builder.md`.

## i18n and content

- Locales under `app/i18n/`; English is reference. `pnpm i18n:validate -- --strict`.
- No hardcoded tenant-specific strings or catalog names in shared components.

## Other

- Browser push: `docs/guides/browser-push-notifications.md`.
- AI context in browser: `@repo/ai-context/storage` only (not bare `@repo/ai-context`).

## Do not

- Import `sonner`, `@radix-ui/react-dialog`, or custom portal dialogs (use `@repo/ui`)
- Mount a second `<Toaster />`
- Embed tenant seed/layout JSON under `apps/web` (use `.local/` + API)

## Enforcement

- `@repo/eslint-config` ui-overlays / ui-toasts / ui-primitives
- `pnpm --filter web test` / `typecheck` / `lint` / Cypress
- `pnpm i18n:validate -- --strict`

